    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk! Watch out for the sneak attack!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_grenade_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Darn it...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I missed?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. We're safe here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "r": 0.9,
        "g": 0.4,
        "b": 0.3,
        "a": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "r": 0.7,
        "g": 0.4,
        "a": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "r": 0.2,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "a": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guh... urgh... aah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "He won't be able to answer you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "From that building!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, is that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frostleaf! Frostleaf, is that you",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "It is. I've taken care of the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry for making you worry, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you injured?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Medic, hurry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "No way... Why is your body all frostbitten? What happened to you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, it's minor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meteorite and Jessica are still in the main square.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "They should be safe for the time being, but it's hard to say how long that's going to last for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "I managed to lure the enemy out, so Reunion hasn't found them yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our cover hasn't been blown yet, so there's no need for concern yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, he's going to come soon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you hiding, little fox?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry and come out. Our game of hide and seek is about to come to an end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "For every minute you stay hidden, I'll break another one of your friends' fingers--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still plan to keep running?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mephisto...!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(He's bluffing. Don't take the bait.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(What is he doing...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion is moving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That little...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to get in touch with Meteorite...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why can't I get through? We've clearly already crossed the contaminated area...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look at this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your communicator?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's... frozen over? Did it get... ruined by the frost?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto is a nobody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's something wandering in this city...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "...that is far more terrifying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Something more terrifying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Yetis. If we run into them, we'll be in serious trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yetis? Are you talking about the Yeti Squadron? What are they exactly...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have time to explain right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they are the ones... behind the sudden temperature drop, as well as our squads' injuries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems like this squad has already established their territory within this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The sky is getting darker. This is a good opportunity for us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be able to cross this open area more easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go rescue Meteorite and Jessica first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll lead the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are those things in the main square? I can't really see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they... statues of some sort? Their shapes are really strange...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this smell makes me want to vomit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over here. Don't get separated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't go look at those things...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "--We have company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's take them out before they notice us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
